    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/73c3bcf10a67f822a8744f68ed8f0759.avif?t=1749380596\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/d0ec99305d6257db9fafab64872be1d5.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/d0ec99305d6257db9fafab64872be1d5.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/d0ec99305d6257db9fafab64872be1d5.mp4?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This video game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/592e7ce73a6a41e18728da0c59af8c67.avif?t=1749380596\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Deadly Quiet</strong></i> is a <strong>4-player co-op asymmetrical horror game</strong> that immerses you in the unsettling atmosphere <strong>of the infamous Hoia Baciu forest</strong>. Viewed through the lens of a <strong>bodycam</strong>, the game delivers an <strong>intense and realistic experience</strong> as you and your team navigate the forest's haunting depths. <strong>Survival hinges on teamwork, strategic decisions, and your ability to adapt to the unpredictable horrors that lurk within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/c24c0a78edf69f4d212d92225626d1b8.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=710 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/c24c0a78edf69f4d212d92225626d1b8.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/c24c0a78edf69f4d212d92225626d1b8.mp4?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every step you take and every sound you make could draw attention to your group, so staying quiet isn\u2019t just advice\u2014it\u2019s your lifeline.</strong></i> Will you and your friends work together to outsmart the sinister forces of the forest, or will the silence consume you all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/7a559850848cec762d7d433f0f6b8c91.webp?t=1749380596\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends embark on a weekend camping trip in the <strong>Hoia Baciu forest.</strong> A <strong>detour along a ravine leads you across a shaky bridge, but disaster strikes as your car plunges into the depths below.</strong> Miraculously, everyone survives, but your vehicle is destroyed. With no signal and night quickly falling, <strong>you\u2019re stranded in the heart of the ominous forest. Your only hope is to traverse the cursed woods and reach the nearby town of Cluj.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/2895c3e00079488ac5e1b44eb21bb035.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=710 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/2895c3e00079488ac5e1b44eb21bb035.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/2895c3e00079488ac5e1b44eb21bb035.mp4?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey deeper, strange and inexplicable events unfold around you. <strong>The forest is a living nightmare, where every step and every sound could mean death.</strong> Mistakes are fatal, and the silence conceals an unspeakable danger. <i><strong>Was that chilling sound in the distance just the wind\u2014or something far worse?</strong></i> Can you and your team survive the horrors of the forest, uncover its secrets, and escape with your sanity intact? <i><strong>Or will the silence claim you all?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/af02b270bd7e4dcd861c2bd6be6b3ee9.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=710 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/af02b270bd7e4dcd861c2bd6be6b3ee9.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/af02b270bd7e4dcd861c2bd6be6b3ee9.mp4?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/07d416dbfbd92792e30f70cf5be732cc.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=710 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/07d416dbfbd92792e30f70cf5be732cc.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/07d416dbfbd92792e30f70cf5be732cc.mp4?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/a298d7c54e95cab5d2e71fc137198c4a.webp?t=1749380596\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your character by choosing from a selection of unique skins, allowing you to customize their appearance to suit your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/05fedb82904a69c05489be7031fe301d.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=710 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/05fedb82904a69c05489be7031fe301d.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/05fedb82904a69c05489be7031fe301d.mp4?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/5693ff76d52840961bdbd8809c9fdedf.webp?t=1749380596\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4-PLAYER CO-OP GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to survive the harrowing challenges of the Hoia Baciu Forest, where cooperation and communication are the keys to survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASYMMETRICAL HORROR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a relentless supernatural predator that adapts to your actions and decisions, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE BODYCAM PERSPECTIVE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the terror firsthand through a dynamic bodycam view that heightens tension and realism.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with teammates using in-game proximity voice chat, but be careful\u2014your voice might attract unwanted attention.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC SOUND SENSITIVITY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest reacts to the sounds you make, creating an intense, stealth-focused experience where every noise could be your last.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAUNTING HOIA BACIU FOREST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the eerie and mysterious Hoia Baciu Forest, a place teeming with supernatural phenomena and cryptic secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERIC SOUND DESIGN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive soundscape amplifies the tension, with every creak, snap, and distant growl adding to the fear.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TERRIFYING VFX\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of realistic graphics and chilling effects brings the Hoia Baciu Forest to life, plunging players into its cursed depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/d0ec99305d6257db9fafab64872be1d5.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/d0ec99305d6257db9fafab64872be1d5.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/d0ec99305d6257db9fafab64872be1d5.mp4?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This video game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/592e7ce73a6a41e18728da0c59af8c67.avif?t=1749380596\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Deadly Quiet</strong></i> is a <strong>4-player co-op asymmetrical horror game</strong> that immerses you in the unsettling atmosphere <strong>of the infamous Hoia Baciu forest</strong>. Viewed through the lens of a <strong>bodycam</strong>, the game delivers an <strong>intense and realistic experience</strong> as you and your team navigate the forest's haunting depths. <strong>Survival hinges on teamwork, strategic decisions, and your ability to adapt to the unpredictable horrors that lurk within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/c24c0a78edf69f4d212d92225626d1b8.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=710 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/c24c0a78edf69f4d212d92225626d1b8.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/c24c0a78edf69f4d212d92225626d1b8.mp4?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every step you take and every sound you make could draw attention to your group, so staying quiet isn\u2019t just advice\u2014it\u2019s your lifeline.</strong></i> Will you and your friends work together to outsmart the sinister forces of the forest, or will the silence consume you all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/7a559850848cec762d7d433f0f6b8c91.webp?t=1749380596\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends embark on a weekend camping trip in the <strong>Hoia Baciu forest.</strong> A <strong>detour along a ravine leads you across a shaky bridge, but disaster strikes as your car plunges into the depths below.</strong> Miraculously, everyone survives, but your vehicle is destroyed. With no signal and night quickly falling, <strong>you\u2019re stranded in the heart of the ominous forest. Your only hope is to traverse the cursed woods and reach the nearby town of Cluj.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/2895c3e00079488ac5e1b44eb21bb035.poster.avif?t=1749380596\" width=710 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/2895c3e00079488ac5e1b44eb21bb035.webm?t=1749380596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419130/extras/2895c3e00