ROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with teammates using in-game proximity voice chat, but be careful\u2014your voice might attract unwanted attention.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC SOUND SENSITIVITY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest reacts to the sounds you make, creating an intense, stealth-focused experience where every noise could be your last.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAUNTING HOIA BACIU FOREST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the eerie and mysterious Hoia Baciu Forest, a place teeming with supernatural phenomena and cryptic secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERIC SOUND DESIGN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive soundscape amplifies the tension, with every creak, snap, and distant growl adding to the fear.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TERRIFYING VFX\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of realistic graphics and chilling effects brings the Hoia Baciu Forest to life, plunging players into its cursed depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
